        Unity.TextMeshPro, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"dialogueParent","value":{"$content":3,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"UnityEngine.GameObject,
        UnityEngine.CoreModule, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"dialogue","value":{"$content":4,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI,
        Unity.TextMeshPro, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1IntroDia","value":{"$content":[{"$content":"After
        the handful of missed classes in recent weeks, you finally had the strength
        to attend one again. Paying attention however, seemed beyond you still. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"You
        sat there dazed and distracted, swarmed by your own mind''s terrible malaise.
        Now that class has concluded, you begin packing your bag and-","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Hold
        on. Someone''s approaching.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Oh! It''s
        Green. You haven''t spoken to them in a month or so. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Sure,
        they''ve texted you a bunch, but . But you didn\u2019t have it in you to
        respond. You doubt they wanted to actually hang out anyways.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"You
        quickly put as good a smile as you can to try and hide the tiredness before
        green reaches you.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Heya!           
        Haven\u2019t seen you in a while, where ya been?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Hi,
        um, good to see you again. Just been a bit occupied recently.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"How
        are you holding out? Everything alright?","$type":"System.String"}],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList,
        Unity.VisualScripting.Core, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1IntroDia_Counter","value":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"System.Int32,
        mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1CharName","value":{"$content":[{"$content":"
        ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":" ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
        ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":" ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
        ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":" ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Green","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Player","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Green","$type":"System.String"}],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList,
        Unity.VisualScripting.Core, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1IntroChar_Counter","value":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"System.Int32,
        mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"OPTIONS","value":{"$content":5,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"UnityEngine.GameObject,
        UnityEngine.CoreModule, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"60bits","value":{"$content":6,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"UnityEngine.GameObject,
        UnityEngine.CoreModule, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"30bits","value":{"$content":7,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"UnityEngine.GameObject,
        UnityEngine.CoreModule, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"0bits","value":{"$content":8,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"UnityEngine.GameObject,
        UnityEngine.CoreModule, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1_60_Dia","value":{"$content":[{"$content":"Nah,
        things have been real rough for me as of late.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Greens
        your friend, you think it might be fine to speak plainly. And if they don\u2019t
        like it, well, it''s their fault for asking, you guess.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"I\u2019ve
        struggled to get out of bed pretty often. Been hard to do anything at all,
        really.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Sorry to hear that. Any idea
        if you''re sick or something?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"No,
        I know I\u2019m not sick. I\u2019ve been\u2026 I don\u2019t know, exhausted?
        Sluggish? I\u2019m not sure. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Makes
        sense, you do look a bit under the weather.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Can\u2019t
        argue with that. You probably look as bad as you feel. You can\u2019t even
        remember if you showered this morning.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Yeah
        sorry, my whole rhythms been off for weeks.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Sounds
        like you might be feeling depressed.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
        Depressed? No no, that seems a bit much. I don\u2019t think I\u2019m doing
        that rough. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Though, now that you
        say that, it\u2019d make sense. No wonder no one wants to hang out with you,
        you\u2019d be ruining everything. More than usual anyway.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Well,
        have you been eating properly?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Eh,
        I haven\u2019t been that hungry recently.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Done
        any of your usual exercises?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Haven\u2019t
        been in the mood.  ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"             
        , what was today\u2019s class about?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Uh
        oh.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"It was about\u2026 biology\u2026
        stuff?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"\u2026","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"C\u2019mon,
        something. Anything you idiot.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"The
        mito\u2026whatchacallit? Pretty sure\u2026","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"              
        ...","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Of course you\u2019d screw this
        up. Not a single thing?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"It definitely
        seems like you are suffering from some form of depression. ","$type":"System.String"}],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList,
        Unity.VisualScripting.Core, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1_CharName_60","value":{"$content":[{"$content":"Player","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
        ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Player","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Green","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Player","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Green","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
        ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Player","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Green","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Player","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
