        Unity.VisualScripting.Core, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1_60_Dia_Counter","value":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"System.Int32,
        mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1_30_Dia","value":{"$content":[{"$content":"Its
        been a bit of good, bit of bad. Nothing too bad","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"You
        haven\u2019t seen Green in quite a while, you\u2019d rather not have your
        first conversation with them in weeks be upsetting. Best to keep the conversation
        light. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Things are a little uneasy,
        but nothing I can\u2019t handle. Biggest issues probably been sleep.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"turns
        their head a bit at that. Oh great you screwed up immediately didn\u2019t
        you?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"How so?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Been
        oversleeping a lot more. It\u2019s been messing with my schedule a tad but
        nothing crazy! ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Are you sure? You
        are slouching a bit more than usual, and your shirt is on backwards.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Shit
        is it? What are you saying, of course you\u2019d screw up putting on a shirt
        of all things.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Oh uhh, didn''t notice
        that, hah. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Your half-hearted attempt
        to lighten that little anecdote seems to flounder accordingly.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Mind
        if I ask how long this has been happening?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Oh
        no worries, it''s only been about\u2026","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Reduce
        it.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":" \u2026A week. Week-ish.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"You
        said that weirdly, and Green definitely noticed. He doesn\u2019t say anything,
        but you wouldn\u2019t be surprised if he\u2019s mocking you for that blunder.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Well,
        have you been eating properly?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Eh,
        I haven\u2019t been that hungry recently.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Done
        any of your usual exercises?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Haven\u2019t
        been in the mood. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"              ,
        what was today\u2019s class about?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Uh
        oh.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"It was about\u2026 biology\u2026
        stuff?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"\u2026","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"C\u2019mon,
        something. Anything you idiot.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"The
        mito\u2026whatchacallit? Pretty sure\u2026","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"          
        ...","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Of course you\u2019d screw this
        up. Not a single thing?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"It definitely
        seems like you are suffering from some form of depression. ","$type":"System.String"}],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList,
        Unity.VisualScripting.Core, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1_CharName_30","value":{"$content":[{"$content":"Player","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
        ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Player","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
