        ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Green","$type":"System.String"}],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList,
        Unity.VisualScripting.Core, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1_30_Dia_Counter","value":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"System.Int32,
        mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1_0_Dia","value":{"$content":[{"$content":"I\u2019m
        doing alright!","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"You don\u2019t wanna
        bother Green with your problems. Just go through the motions to end this
        conversation as quickly as possible. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"No
        complaints here.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Green looks at you,
        seemingly expecting to hear a little more. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
        I uh, haven''t been doing anything interesting lately, soooo how have you
        been? ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"I\u2019ve been doing okay myself.
        Mostly been curious about you and haven''t been answering my texts.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Oh,
        sorry. Been meaning to respond for a while, but it kept slipping my mind.
        ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Not an entire lie. You\u2019ve seen
        the handful of texts from all your friends, but just looking at them can
        be a struggle. Everytime you go to respond you''re filled with an unbearable
        cocktail of exhaustion, anxiety, and self hatred.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"So
        you stopped bothering. Unlikely they actually care anyways and are just trying
        to be polite","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"I\u2019ll make sure to
        do so when I get home.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Oh\u2026 Alright.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"You
        try to return to packing up and heading out, but green doesn''t move. In
        fact, it seems he''s examining you up and down rather thoroughly, struggling
        to hide his\u2026 concern?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Why would
        he be concerned about you of all people? You\u2019re nobody, just some waste
        of- ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"The bags under your eyes are
        quite pronounced, and your breathing is erratic. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"What?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"What?
        Oh, he\u2019s just mocking you. Makes sense.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Have
        you been staying up late, or struggling to sleep properly?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Well,
        I um\u2026 nothing out of the ordinary.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"But
        you have never been like this before.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"It\u2019s
        not too different, I promise I\u2019m fine.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Well,
        have you been eating properly?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Eh,
        I haven\u2019t been that hungry recently.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Done
        any of your usual exercises?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Haven\u2019t
        been in the mood. ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"             ,
        what was today\u2019s class about?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Uh
        oh.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"It was about\u2026 biology\u2026
        stuff?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":" \u2026","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"C\u2019mon,
        something. Anything you idiot.","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"The
        mito\u2026whatchacallit? Pretty sure\u2026","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"              
        ... ","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"Of course you\u2019d screw this
        up. Not a single thing?","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":" It definitely
        seems like you are suffering from some form of depression.","$type":"System.String"}],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"Unity.VisualScripting.AotList,
        Unity.VisualScripting.Core, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null","$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},{"name":"Act1_CharName_0","value":{"$content":[{"$content":"Player","$type":"System.String"},{"$content":"
